OL,3,GNEWSADying patient left in pain by care
OL,4,Adelays, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong waits for privatised NHS services
OL,7,Fhave seen patients forced to wrap
OL,8,Fleaking wounds in plastic bags or spend
OL,9,Ftheir final hours in "avoidable pain",
OL,10,FMPs have warned.
OL,12,FPrivate care provider HCRG took over a
OL,13,Fmajor NHS contract to run community
OL,14,Fhealth services across Bath and North
OL,15,FEast Somerset, Swindon, and Wiltshire
OL,16,Fin April 2025 and, in April this year,
OL,17,Fintroduced a Single Point of Access
OL,18,F(SPA) system.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
