OL,3,GNEWSADying patient left in pain by care
OL,4,Adelays, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut on Wednesday, MPs told a debate
OL,7,Fabout HCRG's performance in the south
OL,8,Fwest that the SPA, a single phone
OL,9,Fnumber for all HCRG services, has not
OL,10,Fworked as planned.
OL,12,FAn HCRG spokesperson said there will
OL,13,Fstill be times when it does not meet
OL,14,Fexpectations and is "sorry when this
OL,15,Fhappens".
